Package: qore-proj-module
Architecture: any
Depends: qore-geos-module (>= 1.0.0~git20260928.1),
         ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-proj-module-doc
Description: coordinate transformations and GEOS integration for Qore
 This package provides the PROJ native module and the ProjGeos source and
 compiled module for coordinate reference systems, batch transformations,
 geodesic calculations and geometry reprojection. Compiler metadata is
 included. It uses the distribution PROJ library and coordinate database.

Package: qore-proj-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-proj-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's PROJ modules
 This package contains HTML API references and example tests for the proj
 native module and ProjGeos.
